# Statistics (exact tests; small n)

- Normal load, cost (replica_minutes): agent (n=4, mean 71.6) < hpa (n=4, mean 77.4): one-sided exact permutation p = 0.014; the other way p = 1.000
- Normal load, NFR violation (nfr_violation_s): agent (n=4, mean 27.5) < hpa (n=4, mean 47.5): one-sided exact permutation p = 0.243; the other way p = 0.800
- stuck: recovered, agent 4/4 vs hpa 0/4: one-sided Fisher exact p = 0.0143
- cpuhog: recovered, agent 4/4 vs hpa 0/4: one-sided Fisher exact p = 0.0143
- Faults pooled: agent 8/8 vs hpa 0/8: one-sided Fisher exact p = 0.00008

